  ('8ab7272f-d5fe-509e-8858-ea7c38f13559', '8ab26caf-d774-51fe-9234-6c1bdc2e9756', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Separated from God by Sin”?$gs$, 1),
  ('fc61c2f7-c772-520c-a3f8-123794ea8bec', '8ab26caf-d774-51fe-9234-6c1bdc2e9756', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
