  ('d365d618-4a0f-5f88-86b1-7ec40691513c', '8fe97626-e186-5773-8b0b-5a87f4e441a4', $gs$Define the main idea in the lesson “Separated from God by Sin” using simple language.$gs$, 1),
  ('7163f3f2-b814-59cc-bc0c-0f5da8456b53', '8fe97626-e186-5773-8b0b-5a87f4e441a4', $gs$What does the key Bible passage teach about God, people, or the Christian life?$gs$, 2),
