  ('cab61ace-191f-5dfd-8d12-6efd64e7abec', '79ee5446-fc19-5ec4-9afc-53c9e9e986eb', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
