  ('03e1d4bf-cf0d-5cb8-9f91-5c2600617929', 'ec498105-96de-575e-970e-ff6ee92f97fd', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “General Revelation: Creation Testifies to God”?$gs$, 1),
  ('22fa4e20-9da1-5dfb-97ad-f4753fccd5db', 'ec498105-96de-575e-970e-ff6ee92f97fd', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
  ('e82fbc63-0ba4-5898-9a30-6e341277c180', 'ec498105-96de-575e-970e-ff6ee92f97fd', $gs$How could this truth shape one attitude or action in your life this week?$gs$, 3)
