  ('c9a00415-c437-5c38-953a-3d0782f312bb', 'f11384b5-289d-5fab-ba5a-080aa6ab6b06', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
