  ('c5ea1a1a-6597-5310-8f7e-cc40f610c8f7', '1a59347c-a73c-5050-ac93-6a902560464c', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Religion Without Regeneration”?$gs$, 1),
  ('75a64dac-b3d2-5618-9505-c58c8392dfc2', '1a59347c-a73c-5050-ac93-6a902560464c', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
