  ('10f954bf-ec29-56f0-8111-4153a7392a3e', 'be16138d-a09c-50a6-ae17-3e094bb64534', $gs$Define the main idea in the lesson “Religion Without Regeneration” using simple language.$gs$, 1),
  ('59724573-948c-5cde-9df0-f6bb825c3bc4', 'be16138d-a09c-50a6-ae17-3e094bb64534', $gs$What does the key Bible passage teach about God, people, or the Christian life?$gs$, 2),
  ('49b25f06-93a9-546a-b812-7061fa6c8380', 'be16138d-a09c-50a6-ae17-3e094bb64534', $gs$Explain why this teaching matters. Give one reason from the lesson.$gs$, 3),
