  ('1f5efa33-0181-584f-a1c7-0bec4d3915fe', 'b2db92c9-f617-566a-8888-714734b61ee4', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Seeing People as God Sees Them”?$gs$, 1),
  ('a86ac05d-2ad1-5cc1-b209-dcc41a2f3b22', 'b2db92c9-f617-566a-8888-714734b61ee4', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
