  ('a7d9918a-0e59-520d-b40f-abcc1777614f', '76c038a9-72f0-5cc9-8160-c3397ace8676', $gs$Define the main idea in the lesson “Seeing People as God Sees Them” using simple language.$gs$, 1),
  ('5b5408af-3501-5a0c-9bb9-7fe372141a81', '76c038a9-72f0-5cc9-8160-c3397ace8676', $gs$What does the key Bible passage teach about God, people, or the Christian life?$gs$, 2),
