  ('87ffd23d-9f69-51f8-8d6b-3df5afce35f8', '5db4bc9a-62a0-5bb2-b28b-852fcf0011d2', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Praying for the Unsaved in Your Life”?$gs$, 1),
