  ('7e9cd5f9-6b26-51e4-97b7-33b2bdb5e000', '45802359-ee8b-5b2b-bf59-8a0ee3d30e73', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
