  ('29860b1a-56a1-5098-baf4-f7ddd19d5a4e', 'ec92de9a-1d72-5f82-a82e-c08d2dd37ad5', $gs$What does the key Bible passage teach about God, people, or the Christian life?$gs$, 2),
