  ('aba2b673-e579-5abf-a160-f376aaca978c', 'ab7f90f7-bff8-54d2-9c04-c7114e4b658d', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “His Bodily Resurrection”?$gs$, 1),
  ('f47da6d6-d68d-58bc-a340-499924ff38c1', 'ab7f90f7-bff8-54d2-9c04-c7114e4b658d', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
