  ('f9dd48a3-7491-5dea-8ade-4a686c6c26f9', '2630eddb-e2ea-5107-b631-1d9852e639ad', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “His Ascension and Present Reign”?$gs$, 1),
  ('5a1c38f8-6946-58fd-b2b8-50474734b03c', '2630eddb-e2ea-5107-b631-1d9852e639ad', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
  ('42a720d8-2bbd-58b9-b4cf-24e1bace03e5', '2630eddb-e2ea-5107-b631-1d9852e639ad', $gs$How could this truth shape one attitude or action in your life this week?$gs$, 3)
