  ('88c33cee-77e7-5cf0-b5eb-2301c45658f7', '2bfae05b-7a2c-5769-9521-a5cfac09ebb6', $gs$Define the main idea in the lesson “His Ascension and Present Reign” using simple language.$gs$, 1),
  ('163bd995-f63f-5ee5-a9f8-06a94c077420', '2bfae05b-7a2c-5769-9521-a5cfac09ebb6', $gs$What does the key Bible passage teach about God, people, or the Christian life?$gs$, 2),
