  ('ec56ff8c-4ff0-509e-9ebf-88390dad321f', '9a5a998e-da99-52d4-8d83-892660185481', $gs$Define the main idea in the lesson “Christ as Lord” using simple language.$gs$, 1),
  ('2a141bc4-ed59-5342-b721-54060ac7f9fb', '9a5a998e-da99-52d4-8d83-892660185481', $gs$What does the key Bible passage teach about God, people, or the Christian life?$gs$, 2),
