  ('f8e5c77a-c0fa-56ef-9e3d-91c3fb52dfad', 'ceafd5e0-5294-5176-ba5f-8f63e98bf7b5', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Worshiping Christ Rightly”?$gs$, 1),
