  ('01d64869-fd2a-5fb2-a2e9-32101e167358', 'f3bd9cc6-f59f-5572-9b2f-9c8140e33314', 'paragraph', $gs${"text":"Definition and simple explanation\n\nThis lesson focuses on A Lifetime of Knowing Christ. Begin by reading the key Bible passage in its full context. Notice who is speaking, who is being addressed, what problem or question is being discussed, and what the passage teaches about God and people. The lesson title gives the subject, but the passage provides the foundation for understanding it."}$gs$::jsonb, 1, false, false),
