  ('efd0a943-22e4-5f74-92ea-cf94b4408d3b', '4e1ac2a0-b595-5509-a15f-dafef10ddde5', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
