  ('3f59f168-8550-5b64-bdaf-1bb918ea10f9', 'd6f733d3-6d15-5591-ad2b-9364534ec539', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
