  ('5730b80a-6712-5199-8cd7-4803affdae60', '2302c20b-d6fa-5ca3-a270-75ae6d19dd67', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Christ’s Resurrection for Our Justification”?$gs$, 1),
