  ('512385a7-516c-5fb4-b63c-51c79baef693', '3155ed67-9f25-5000-a9ce-8c2da5b8df94', $gs$Define the main idea in the lesson “Christ’s Resurrection for Our Justification” using simple language.$gs$, 1),
  ('165af9e7-e43a-5f37-b3cd-9647d58f0b05', '3155ed67-9f25-5000-a9ce-8c2da5b8df94', $gs$What does the key Bible passage teach about God, people, or the Christian life?$gs$, 2),
  ('34374761-82ce-52d4-9f2f-25468956c3b8', '3155ed67-9f25-5000-a9ce-8c2da5b8df94', $gs$Explain why this teaching matters. Give one reason from the lesson.$gs$, 3),
