  ('43adc0e5-3538-5aa9-9ae5-e52e505429d5', '721b800e-00bd-5bc4-8de9-eeb91da25aca', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
