  ('661e6f4d-e0b8-51ce-9004-6cd616c2834b', 'bc52902f-c1d7-52dd-9604-d320ccd22dae', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Surrendering Control of Your Life”?$gs$, 1),
  ('0b68edb1-a677-5839-b6b8-dd067f0bbcc1', 'bc52902f-c1d7-52dd-9604-d320ccd22dae', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
