  ('86a53058-a409-592f-8331-d70fc7b464e1', '38b0b99b-4145-5817-9ff1-90cd77fef653', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Counting the Cost of Following Christ”?$gs$, 1),
  ('8b6b17fd-a84b-5b63-89dd-6c0049117980', '38b0b99b-4145-5817-9ff1-90cd77fef653', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
  ('d9e4fadf-2a11-51a3-a1fd-abd59beaa9b3', '38b0b99b-4145-5817-9ff1-90cd77fef653', $gs$How could this truth shape one attitude or action in your life this week?$gs$, 3)
