  ('89517f5e-9b0f-5a0b-9ada-07014214cb88', '72af4ca8-1b17-519d-9ca2-8877fab4eede', $gs$Define the main idea in the lesson “Counting the Cost of Following Christ” using simple language.$gs$, 1),
  ('7252857d-c6bd-53cd-9bb0-fbe85f574faa', '72af4ca8-1b17-519d-9ca2-8877fab4eede', $gs$What does the key Bible passage teach about God, people, or the Christian life?$gs$, 2),
  ('65de0ed5-af48-5d89-81ae-ce55b9365857', '72af4ca8-1b17-519d-9ca2-8877fab4eede', $gs$Explain why this teaching matters. Give one reason from the lesson.$gs$, 3),
