  ('f561aed0-3fda-588e-a401-9fbc7bf15e83', 'bf438b43-7905-5b94-b3c0-291bd3e2b9cb', 3, 'teaching', $gs$Important things to remember$gs$, $gs$• This teaching should be understood alongside the whole Bible passage, not as an isolated slogan.
