  ('d3f3ca26-5905-5ae6-b87c-7e9f7fd397a9', '3fb22436-f60b-51f6-b035-3bb3a37ffa4e', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
