  ('e2235333-c0f1-57a3-9dd9-c8437ca4df1c', '873efb75-013c-5f4a-b7de-e085572952d7', $gs$Define the main idea in the lesson “Assurance Rests on God’s Promise, Not Feelings” using simple language.$gs$, 1),
