  ('a5f23e03-7dc5-5af7-a64d-10977cd0c33d', 'a47bf485-9984-531a-afe1-97f941e5dba9', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Doubt During Difficult Seasons”?$gs$, 1),
  ('e5238e42-c1f5-59a5-877a-99c32ddbdf61', 'a47bf485-9984-531a-afe1-97f941e5dba9', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
