  ('8ea5d9bf-73c4-5099-8819-0d9fa70edb58', 'c52882e8-f2d0-5065-a72e-42ca7926bc04', $gs$Define the main idea in the lesson “Returning to Scripture When Doubt Arises” using simple language.$gs$, 1),
  ('a2cfc266-d983-5e96-b92e-13c879717b3d', 'c52882e8-f2d0-5065-a72e-42ca7926bc04', $gs$What does the key Bible passage teach about God, people, or the Christian life?$gs$, 2),
