  ('eacc39f2-ea11-5390-8105-006847f31044', 'abe2fc6f-441c-55d9-99e8-31ce0906f176', $gs$In your own words, what is the main point of “Counting It a Privilege, Not a Formality”?$gs$, 1),
  ('d7bd14a1-8a23-5bb8-a2dd-a6f843472907', 'abe2fc6f-441c-55d9-99e8-31ce0906f176', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
  ('d2571ff9-0240-5138-91f7-b970ff2e2585', 'abe2fc6f-441c-55d9-99e8-31ce0906f176', $gs$How could this truth shape one attitude or action in your life this week?$gs$, 3)
