  ('881819b4-1391-5b5b-bda6-98627be72ccc', 'bf8d8cdd-9c1a-52fd-8aa4-9c996529155e', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
