  ('ac725610-4ad6-57aa-ac94-6a5a8dc2ac95', 'c5c7a446-ac88-5c6b-8b82-3a4530e35f5f', $gs$What part of this teaching is easiest for you to understand, and what part would you like to discuss further?$gs$, 2),
